= [+ date_label +] — Rails, reactors and the social question

**Paulina Matysiak** can now name the developmental project, **[+
matysiak_project_party +]**, but not yet its coalition. A national investment
bank, rail and nuclear programme can be bound to collective bargaining and the
broader Left. Or the party can make sovereignty, regional grievance and freedom
from liberal climate timetables its organising line, gaining voters PiS thought
it owned and deepening the cultural break with progressives.

- @matysiak_labor_compact
- @matysiak_sovereignty

@matysiak_labor_compact
title: Bind nuclear, rail and regional investment to labour power
subtitle: Advantage: state capacity plus unions and wider-Left cooperation. Cost: fiscal obligations and less cultural differentiation.
